SUMMARY:Potential Jazz Ensemble & India Jones
DESCRIPTION:🎷🍷 Live Music & Food Truck Night 🍛🎶\nFriday\, August 7 | 5–8:30 PM\nTicket Includes: Glass of Wine & Live Music\nKick off your weekend with an evening of smooth jazz\, incredible food\, and award-winning wine at Great Bear Vineyards!\nSettle in with a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine\, enjoy the peaceful vineyard views\, and let the Potential Jazz Ensemble provide the soundtrack to your Friday evening. Come hungry—India Jones will be onsite serving authentic Indian cuisine from 5–8 PM\, with live music from 6–7:30 PM.\n🎷 Music by Potential Jazz Ensemble\nA vibrant collective of talented musicians\, the Potential Jazz Ensemble brings together a shared passion for jazz\, creativity\, and collaboration. Featuring saxophone\, bass\, guitar\, piano\, and percussion\, their lively performances blend timeless jazz traditions with fresh\, contemporary energy. The band includes Tommy Meyers (saxophone)\, Harold Jackson (bass)\, Jim Baxter (guitar)\, John Rominger (piano)\, and Jessie Norfleet (percussion).\n🍛 Food by India Jones\nWe’re excited to welcome India Jones to the winery! Enjoy authentic Indian favorites like their famous Butter Chicken\, Vegetable Coconut Curry\, and Channa Masala\, all made with fresh\, organic ingredients and bold\, delicious flavors. Please help us support this fantastic local food truck by purchasing your dinner onsite and leaving outside food at home.\n✨ Your Evening Includes\n🍷 A glass of Great Bear estate-grown wine\n🎷 Live jazz from the Potential Jazz Ensemble\n🍛 Authentic Indian cuisine available for purchase\n🌅 Beautiful vineyard views and a relaxing summer atmosphere\nGather your friends\, bring your appetite\, and join us for an evening of great music\, delicious food\, and unforgettable vineyard vibes. We can’t wait to see you!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/potential-jazz-ensemble-india-jones/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Potential-Jazz-Ensemble-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
